{"id":"4fce91a92eb02a01","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/722_ALCH.md","title":"722 ALCH","display":"722_ALCH","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"722-ALCH\">722 ALCH</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 是角色名集合。ALCH 是 ALC 加角色层级的句法包含演算。</p>\n<p>概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>角色包含式构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rinc}(R,S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rinc}(R,S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in N_R\">\\(R,S\\in N_R\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\sqsubseteq S\">\\(R\\sqsubseteq S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rinc}:N_R\\times N_R\\to\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rinc}:N_R\\times N_R\\to\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式、TBox-与-RBox\">3. 包含式、TBox 与 RBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>角色包含式集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}=N_R\\times N_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}=N_R\\times N_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 和 RBox 分别是有限集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-角色层级闭包\">4. 角色层级闭包</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}\\subseteq N_R\\times N_R\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}\\subseteq N_R\\times N_R\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小关系：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}R\">\\(R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,S)\\in\\mathcal H\">\\((R,S)\\in\\mathcal H\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S\">\\(R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S\">\\(R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}T\">\\(S\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}T\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}T\">\\(R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"5.-自由名字与替换\">5. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\">\\(\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-公理集合\">6. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal H}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal H}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\\)</span> 是 ALC 本地布尔公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>角色层级诱导公理族定义如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal H}\n=\n\\{\\forall S.C\\sqsubseteq\\forall R.C:\nR,S\\in N_R,\\ R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal H}\n=\n\\{\\forall S.C\\sqsubseteq\\forall R.C:\nR,S\\in N_R,\\ R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{\\exists R.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists S.C:\nR,S\\in N_R,\\ R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{\\exists R.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists S.C:\nR,S\\in N_R,\\ R\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}S,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-推理规则\">7. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-证明对象\">8. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,I)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,I)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{m-1}=I\">\\(I_{m-1}=I\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<p>以下第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 个条件逐一、分别定义谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i)\">\\(L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq\\ell\\leq 7\">\\(1\\leq\\ell\\leq 7\\)</span>）；每行至少满足其中一个条件。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可的唯一组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{7} L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{7} L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节的证明条件是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,i)\\)</span>；本节定义的证明对象、证明谓词及可导出关系均采用此条件。序列须非空、有限且逐行有型；末项条件和各分支的严格早索引条件同时保留。</p>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,(C,D))\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,(C,D))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-可导出关系\">9. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,(C,D))\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,(C,D))\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-语义结构与解释\">10. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}=\n\\{(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\varnothing):\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\text{ 有限且 }\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}=\n\\{(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\varnothing):\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\text{ 有限且 }\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\)</span> 是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg C⟧=\\Delta\\setminus⟦ C⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcup D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cup⟦ D⟧,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg C⟧=\\Delta\\setminus⟦ C⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcup D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cup⟦ D⟧,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\exists R.C⟧=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\exists R.C⟧=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系与语义后承\">11. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCH}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}R\\sqsubseteq S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\iota_R(R)\\subseteq\\iota_R(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}R\\sqsubseteq S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\iota_R(R)\\subseteq\\iota_R(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\varnothing)\">\\(\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal H,\\varnothing)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\mathcal K\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}I)\n\\land\n(\\forall J\\in\\mathcal H\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\mathcal K\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}I)\n\\land\n(\\forall J\\in\\mathcal H\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\Phi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Phi\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\cup\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n(\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\mathcal K\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\Phi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Phi\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\cup\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n(\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\mathcal K\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-特征差异\">12. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALCH 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{roleClosure}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{transRole},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{roleClosure}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{transRole},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求 RBox <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 与闭包关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathcal H}\\)</span> 均为本系统对象；第 6 节用它们生成全称和存在限制的层级公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\preceq_{\\mathcal H},\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\mathsf{RInc}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\preceq_{\\mathcal H},\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCH}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统不含逆角色、传递角色、数目限制或名词；语义只解释 ALCH 的角色层级和概念构造子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"722-ALCH","text":"722 ALCH","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式、TBox-与-RBox","text":"3. 包含式、TBox 与 RBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-角色层级闭包","text":"4. 角色层级闭包","level":1},{"id":"5.-自由名字与替换","text":"5. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"6.-公理集合","text":"6. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"7.-推理规则","text":"7. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"8.-证明对象","text":"8. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"9.-可导出关系","text":"9. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"10.-语义结构与解释","text":"10. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"11.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"11. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"12.-特征差异","text":"12. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"13.-整个形式系统","text":"13. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)","display":false},{"tex":"N_C","display":false},{"tex":"N_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCH}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{